You are reviewing an Azure Blob Lifecycle Management rule defined by the following JSON snippet:

```json
{
  "rules": [
    {
      "enabled": true,
      "name": "move-to-cool",
      "type": "Lifecycle",
      "definition": {
        "actions": {
          "baseBlob": {
            "tierToCool": {
              "daysAfterModificationGreaterThan": 30
            }
          }
        },
        "filters": {
          "blobTypes": [ "blockBlob" ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

What action does this rule execute?
